{
  "manifest_version": 3,
  "name": "OA Corp：殘留遮罩清除按鈕",
  "version": "1.0",
  "description": "(corp-orphan-backdrop-closer-btn) 偵測 Bootstrap modal 關閉後未被移除的孤兒遮罩，於畫面右側中央注入一鍵清除按鈕，恢復頁面操作",
  "content_scripts": [
    {
      "matches": [
        "https://corp.orangeapple.co/*"
      ],
      "js": [
        "content.js"
      ],
      "run_at": "document_idle"
    }
  ],
  "icons": {
    "16": "icon16.png",
    "48": "icon48.png",
    "128": "icon128.png"
  }
}
